# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Environment variables (contain secrets)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Capacitor native projects — generated locally via `npx cap add android/ios`.
# The web app + capacitor.config.ts are the source of truth; the native
# folders contain per-machine Gradle/Xcode state and shouldn't be committed
# until we're ready to publish a signed release from CI.
/android
/ios

# Keystore + signing secrets — NEVER commit these
*.keystore
*.jks
android/keystore.properties
android/local.properties

# Exception: the DEBUG keystore is non-secret by convention (Android's own
# default uses the exact same "android" credentials). Committing it keeps
# every CI-built debug APK on the same signing cert so users can upgrade
# in place instead of hitting "package conflicts with existing package".
!android-templates/debug.keystore

